### GET ingredients
GET http://localhost:3000/ingredients?pageSize=20&sortBy=name

### Create ingredient
POST http://localhost:3000/ingredients
Authorization: Bearer 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "description": "",
    "photoUrl": "",
    "containsAlcohol": true
} 

### Update ingredient
Patch http://localhost:3000/ingredients/{id}
Authorization: Bearer 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "description": "",
    "photoUrl": "",
    "containsAlcohol": true
}